            524
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "With the approval of the general manager of the company，we will maintain your company’s qualification of certification registration. So you could continue enjoying the rights and obligations of using the certificates and logos of the certifications,which will be validuntil 2026-06-18.",
